import Mathlib
import ZInQKernel.Contrib.OneProof.RC.Odd.DivisionsFinal
import ZInQKernel.Contrib.OneProof.RC.Odd.Visibility
import ZInQKernel.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.OddMinimum

/-!
# Lane RC12-odd: Elliot's App F constructions as statements, and their consumers

Manuscript (11/5), Appendix F. The constructions below are Elliot's own and are not formalized
(kind ELLIOT): the weighted ternary theta form and its transformation law (tex 8409–9100, with
Weil, Acta Math. 111 (1964), I.13–I.14, II.25–II.30, III Thm 6 — PRINT, locators UNVERIFIED; Voight,
*Quaternion algebras*, Main Thm 14.6.1, Prop. 14.6.7 — PRINT, UNVERIFIED; the class-set comparison
cited to Jetchev–Kane arXiv:0908.3905 §§1.1–1.2, 2.5 (arXiv v1; journal version unread): GLUE, since
Ribet 1990 Prop. 3.3 reports it without proof and a Lean proof is in progress; the Hecke,
Atkin–Lehner and Frobenius compatibilities: ELLIOT, asserted in the manuscript). Half-integral-weight forms, quaternion orders
and the Weil representation do not exist in Mathlib, so each construction is stated by the property
its consumers use: the coefficient function of one actual stage with its recurrence (O.6) and
support (`OddStageCore`), and the comparison (O.7) (`ThetaComparison`).

**The coefficient ring.** The coefficients of an actual stage lie in `𝒪/2^M𝒪`, where `𝒪` is "the
valuation ring at a place above two of the field generated by the fixed root-character values at
primes dividing `N`", independent of `M` and `ℓ₀` (tex 8567–8570, 8415, 8617–8620). The root
characters `α_p` have finite `2`-power order (O.3) (tex 8504–8512), so `η = η_B χ_{h_*}` takes values in
`𝒪^×` that need not be rational, and `𝒪` may be ramified ("not reduction modulo the maximal ideal of a
ramified coefficient ring", tex 9633–9634). The operators of (O.9)–(O.11) act on the actual form
(tex 9497, "a congruence modulo `2^M 𝒪_coef`", tex 9614–9615, 9917–9918), and the coefficient at a
non-squarefree index keeps the phases `η(p)^s` of (O.6) (tex 9562). Only the squarefree coefficients
used for valuation are rational integers after phase removal (tex 2538, (3.8) at 2527–2530, (O.7)).
So the stage statements are over `StageRing 𝒪 M = 𝒪 ⧸ (2^M)` for an arbitrary commutative ring
`𝒪`. The earlier model `ZMod (2^M)` (lane RC12) is, up to the canonical isomorphism, the case
`𝒪 = ℤ`, which suffices only when every value of `η` is a rational integer (quadratic root
characters).

**The depth of an odd stage is not an input.** The text states it only as App G's conclusion
(Proposition `ex:app-odd-minimum`, tex 10151–10256; the same argument in §7, tex 2538–2551): with
`δ_o` the attained ultrafilter minimum, *for each finite operator budget* `|U| ≤ W_U` and `R ≥ 2`,
*on a set of stages in the ultrafilter*, every admissible squarefree `D` of the stage support has
`v₂ a_M(D) ≥ min(N_0 + R, ω(D) + δ_o)`, `N_0 = max(0, δ_o + W_U)`, `M ≥ N_0 + R` — and "no single
finite stage is claimed to serve every unbounded weight range" (tex 10168–10169). Accordingly:
* `OddStageSource 𝒪 W_U R M δ_o …` — a stage valid for that budget: `N_0 + R ≤ M` and the source
  hypotheses with depth `δ_o` truncated at `N_0 + R` (not at `M`);
* `sourceHyp_depth_of_oddMinimumF6` (**PROVED**, the bridge from batch 3's `oddMinimumF6_proof`) and
  `sourceHyp_depth_of_isLeast` (from the minimum, through `f6_of_isLeast`, `stageChoice_proof`): the
  depth field `SourceHyp.depth` at truncation `N_0 + R`, eventually along the ultrafilter;
* `oddStageSource_eventually`, `oddStageSource_of_witness` (**PROVED**): with the stage cores, the
  valid stage for every budget, eventually along the ultrafilter;
* `O9_odd_stage`, `O11_odd_stage` (**PROVED**) — the integer divisions at a valid stage, in the
  text's form: `v₂ B_U[J r m²] ≥ min{R, ω(r)}` and the integrality of `H_U` (tex 10214–10233,
  9578–9584, 9618–9636); `O9_eventually` combines them with the stage choice.

`visibility_of_comparison` ((O.8) in the skeleton's shape) is unchanged.
-/

namespace ZInQ.Manuscript.RC.Odd

open Filter

/-- **The coefficient ring of an actual odd stage of precision `M`**: `𝒪/2^M𝒪` for the fixed
coefficient ring `𝒪` (tex 8567–8570, 8415, 8617–8620; see the module docstring). -/
abbrev StageRing (O : Type*) [CommRing O] (M : ℕ) : Type _ := O ⧸ Ideal.span {(2 : O) ^ M}

/-- **ELLIOT (`ex:app-theta-form` (O.4)–(O.6), tex 8409–9100; support tex 2530–2532, 9471–9476).**
One actual stage of precision `M`, coefficients in `𝒪/2^M𝒪`: the coefficient function `a`
(`a(n) = H_M(mn)`) satisfies the recurrence (O.6) at every good prime (`a_q ≡ q + 1 (mod 4)`,
`ψ/η = ±1`), `a(0) = 0`, vanishes at indices not prime to the coefficient support and at squarefree
parameters outside the stage support `adm` (admissible, `(D/ℓ₀) = 1`), and `η` is completely
multiplicative. No depth is assumed: the depth is App G's conclusion (`oddStageSource_eventually`).
Non-vacuity: `oddStageSource_example`. -/
def OddStageCore (O : Type*) [CommRing O] (M : ℕ) (η : ℕ → StageRing O M) (Good adm : ℕ → Prop)
    (ap : ℕ → ℤ) (a : ℕ → StageRing O M) : Prop :=
  SourceCore η Good adm ap a

/-- `N_0 + R` with `N_0 = max(0, δ_o + W_U)` (App G, tex 10208–10209), as a natural number. -/
def budgetLevel (δo : ℤ) (WU R : ℕ) : ℕ := (max 0 (δo + WU) + R).toNat

theorem budgetLevel_cast (δo : ℤ) (WU R : ℕ) :
    ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ) = max 0 (δo + WU) + R := by
  unfold budgetLevel; omega

/-- **A stage valid for the finite operator budget `|U| ≤ W_U` and `R`** (App F, tex 9450–9453:
"first fix a finite operator budget `|U| ≤ W`, take `R ≥ 2`, and choose an actual stage satisfying
the depth inequalities of Proposition `ex:app-odd-minimum`"; App G, tex 10208–10227). Coefficients
in `𝒪/2^M𝒪`; the stage precision satisfies `M ≥ N_0 + R`, and the coefficient source satisfies
`SourceHyp` with the integer depth `δ_o` truncated at `N_0 + R`: at every squarefree `D` of the stage
support, `v₂ a_M(D) ≥ min(N_0 + R, δ_o + ω(D))`. This is exactly what App G proves at the chosen
stage ((F.6) through the weight threshold for visible `D`, `v₂ a_M(D) ≥ M` for invisible ones, (F.5)
above the threshold), and it is produced, eventually along the ultrafilter, by
`oddStageSource_eventually`. (Correction, lane RC27: the earlier form truncated the depth at `M`,
asserted it at one stage for every index and every weight, which the text does not claim, and used
`ℤ/2^M` coefficients.) Non-vacuity: `oddStageSource_example`. -/
def OddStageSource (O : Type*) [CommRing O] (WU R M : ℕ) (δo : ℤ) (η : ℕ → StageRing O M)
    (Good adm : ℕ → Prop) (ap : ℕ → ℤ) (a : ℕ → StageRing O M) : Prop :=
  budgetLevel δo WU R ≤ M ∧ SourceHyp (budgetLevel δo WU R) δo η Good adm ap a

variable {O : Type*} [CommRing O]

/-- **PROVED ((O.9) at a valid odd stage, tex 9578–9584, 10214–10227).** For every list `U` of
distinct good primes in the budget (`|U| ≤ W_U`) and every Fourier index `n`:
`v₂ (∏_{p∈U}(U_p − η(p)V_p) g)[n] ≥ n_U + min{R, ω(r)}`, `n_U = δ_o + |U|`, i.e.
`v₂ B_U[J r m²] ≥ min{R, ω(r)}` ("(O.9) holds with its right side replaced by its minimum with
`R`"; `ω(r) = |oddPart n ∖ U|`). -/
theorem O9_odd_stage {WU R M : ℕ} {δo : ℤ} {η : ℕ → StageRing O M} {Good adm : ℕ → Prop}
    {ap : ℕ → ℤ} {a : ℕ → StageRing O M} (H : OddStageSource O WU R M δo η Good adm ap a)
    (U : List ℕ) (hnd : U.Nodup) (hU : ∀ p ∈ U, Good p) (hWU : U.length ≤ WU) (n : ℕ) :
    (2 : StageRing O M) ^ (δo + U.length + min (R : ℤ) (oddPart n \ U.toFinset).card).toNat ∣
      TL η U a n := by
  refine two_pow_dvd_of_le ?_ (O9 H.2 U hnd hU n)
  have := budgetLevel_cast δo WU R
  omega

/-- **PROVED ((O.11) at a valid odd stage, tex 9618–9636, 10228–10233).** In matching parity, for
`n = J m₁²` with `J ⊆ U` and every good odd `m`: the undivided numerator of
`H_U = (B_U − ∑_J B_U[J] Θ_J)/2` is divisible by `2^{n_U + 1}` (so `H_U` is integral at this stage),
for every `U` in the budget, as soon as `R ≥ 1`. -/
theorem O11_odd_stage {WU R M : ℕ} {δo : ℤ} {η : ℕ → StageRing O M} {Good adm : ℕ → Prop}
    {ap : ℕ → ℤ} {a : ℕ → StageRing O M} (H : OddStageSource O WU R M δo η Good adm ap a)
    (hR : 1 ≤ R) (U : List ℕ) (hnd : U.Nodup) (hU : ∀ p ∈ U, Good p) (hWU : U.length ≤ WU)
    (θ : ℕ → ℤ) (hθ : ∀ m, Odd m → Odd (θ m)) {n m : ℕ} (hn : n ≠ 0) (hm : m ≠ 0) (hmodd : Odd m)
    (hJ : oddPart n ⊆ U.toFinset) (hgood : ∀ q ∈ m.primeFactors, Good q) :
    (2 : StageRing O M) ^ (δo + U.length + 1).toNat ∣
      TL η U a (n * m ^ 2) - TL η U a n * (η m * (θ m : StageRing O M)) := by
  refine two_pow_dvd_of_le ?_ (O11_theta H.2 U hnd hU θ hθ hn hm hmodd hJ hgood)
  have := budgetLevel_cast δo WU R
  omega

/-- **PROVED (tex 10231–10233: "`M − n_U − 1 ≥ 1` for every reading and first-shell omission in the
budget").** At a valid stage with `R ≥ 2`, `n_U + 2 ≤ M` for every `|U| ≤ W_U`. -/
theorem OddStageSource.precision {WU R M : ℕ} {δo : ℤ} {η : ℕ → StageRing O M}
    {Good adm : ℕ → Prop} {ap : ℕ → ℤ} {a : ℕ → StageRing O M}
    (H : OddStageSource O WU R M δo η Good adm ap a) (hR : 2 ≤ R) {u : ℕ} (hu : u ≤ WU) :
    δo + u + 2 ≤ (M : ℤ) := by
  have h1 := budgetLevel_cast δo WU R
  have h2 : ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ) ≤ M := by exact_mod_cast H.1
  omega

/-! ### App G's stage choice produces the depth and a valid odd stage (batch 3's nodes) -/

/-- `ω(D)` of batch 3 at a natural number is the genuine `ω(D)`. -/
theorem appG_omega_natCast (D : ℕ) :
    ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega (D : ℤ) =
      ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D :=
  rfl

/-- **PROVED.** The link between batch 3's valuations and divisibility in the stage ring: if the
actual coefficient is `ζ` times the integer `z` (the phase-removed coefficient, tex 2538, (3.8)) and
`k ≤ v₂ z`, then `2^k ∣ ζ z` in `𝒪/2^M𝒪`. -/
theorem two_pow_dvd_stage_of_le_vZ (O : Type*) [CommRing O] (M : ℕ) (ζ : O) {z : ℤ} {k : ℕ}
    (h : ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ vZ z) :
    (2 : StageRing O M) ^ k ∣ Ideal.Quotient.mk (Ideal.span {(2 : O) ^ M}) (ζ * (z : O)) := by
  have h1 := map_dvd (Int.castRingHom O) ((two_pow_dvd_iff_le_vZ z k).mpr h)
  rw [map_pow, map_ofNat] at h1
  have h2 := map_dvd (Ideal.Quotient.mk (Ideal.span {(2 : O) ^ M})) (dvd_mul_of_dvd_right h1 ζ)
  rwa [map_pow, map_ofNat] at h2

/-- **PROVED (App G, tex 10190–10227: the depth at a stage chosen for one budget, from the
minimum).** Stages are natural numbers with one ultrafilter `U` and precisions `M θ → ∞`;
`v θ D` is `v₂ a_{M_θ}(D)` (batch 3's convention); `a θ` is the stage's coefficient function in any
commutative ring `S θ`, linked to `v` at the squarefree parameters of the stage support by `hva`.
From (F.5) at every stage (batch 3's `CoarseF5`) and `δ_o` the least element of batch 3's
`DepthSet`, through batch 3's `f6_of_isLeast` ((F.6)) and `stageChoice_proof` (the stage choice):
for every budget `W_U` and `R ≥ 2`, on a set of stages in the ultrafilter, `N_0 + R ≤ M_θ` and the
depth field of `SourceHyp` holds at truncation `N_0 + R`. -/
theorem sourceHyp_depth_of_isLeast (U : Ultrafilter ℕ) (M : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hM : Tendsto M (U : Filter ℕ) atTop) (v : ℕ → ℤ → WithTop ℤ) (adm : ℕ → ℤ → Prop)
    {S : ℕ → Type*} [∀ θ, CommRing (S θ)] (a : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → S θ)
    (hva : ∀ θ (D k : ℕ), Squarefree D → adm θ D → ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ v θ D →
      (2 : S θ) ^ k ∣ a θ D)
    (Ccoarse : ℚ)
    (hF5 : ∀ θ D, adm θ D → ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.QLe
      (min (M θ : ℚ) (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega D - Ccoarse)) (v θ D))
    {δo : ℤ} (hδ : IsLeast (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.DepthSet U M v adm) δo)
    (WU R : ℕ) (hR : 2 ≤ R) :
    ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ), budgetLevel δo WU R ≤ M θ ∧
      ∀ D : ℕ, Squarefree D → adm θ D →
        (2 : S θ) ^ (min ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ)
          (δo + ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D)).toNat ∣ a θ D := by
  have hF6 := ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.f6_of_isLeast hF5 hδ
  obtain ⟨Tw, -, -, hB⟩ :=
    ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.stageChoice_proof U M v adm Ccoarse δo WU R hR hM hF5 hF6
  filter_upwards [hB] with θ hθ
  obtain ⟨-, hMa, -, -, hD⟩ := hθ
  have hbl := budgetLevel_cast δo WU R
  refine ⟨by omega, fun D hsq hadm => ?_⟩
  set k : ℕ := (min ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ)
    (δo + ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D)).toNat with hk
  by_cases hk0 : k = 0
  · rw [hk0, pow_zero]; exact one_dvd _
  apply hva θ D k hsq hadm
  have hkz : (k : ℤ) = min ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ)
      (δo + ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D) := by omega
  obtain ⟨hbig, hsmall⟩ := hD (D : ℤ) hadm
  rw [appG_omega_natCast] at hbig hsmall
  by_cases hT : Tw < ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D
  · refine le_trans ?_ (hbig hT)
    exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr (by omega)
  · refine le_trans ?_ (hsmall (not_lt.mp hT))
    exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr (by omega)

/-- **PROVED (the bridge from batch 3's `oddMinimumF6_proof` to `SourceHyp.depth`; App G,
Proposition `ex:app-odd-minimum`, tex 10190–10227).** From (F.5) at every stage and the fixed visible
witness ((3.7), (O.2), (O.7): one admissible `D_w` with one fixed valuation `c < M_θ` on a set of
stages in the ultrafilter) — exactly the hypotheses of batch 3's `OddMinimumF6` — together with the
advancing stages and the link `hva`: there is an integer `δ_o`, the least element of `DepthSet`
(batch 3's `oddMinimumF6_proof`), such that for every finite operator budget `W_U` and `R ≥ 2`, on a
set of stages in the ultrafilter, `N_0 + R ≤ M_θ` and the restated depth field of `SourceHyp`
(depth `δ_o`, truncation `N_0 + R`) holds at every squarefree `D` of the stage support. The set
depends on `(W_U, R)` ("It does not select one stage for infinitely many budgets", tex 10234). -/
theorem sourceHyp_depth_of_oddMinimumF6 (U : Ultrafilter ℕ) (M : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hM : Tendsto M (U : Filter ℕ) atTop) (v : ℕ → ℤ → WithTop ℤ) (adm : ℕ → ℤ → Prop)
    {S : ℕ → Type*} [∀ θ, CommRing (S θ)] (a : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → S θ)
    (hva : ∀ θ (D k : ℕ), Squarefree D → adm θ D → ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ v θ D →
      (2 : S θ) ^ k ∣ a θ D)
    (Ccoarse : ℚ)
    (hF5 : ∀ θ D, adm θ D → ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.QLe
      (min (M θ : ℚ) (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega D - Ccoarse)) (v θ D))
    (hw : ∃ Dw c : ℤ, ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ), adm θ Dw ∧ v θ Dw = (c : WithTop ℤ) ∧
      (c : WithTop ℤ) < M θ) :
    ∃ δo : ℤ, IsLeast (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.DepthSet U M v adm) δo ∧
      ∀ WU R : ℕ, 2 ≤ R → ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ), budgetLevel δo WU R ≤ M θ ∧
        ∀ D : ℕ, Squarefree D → adm θ D →
          (2 : S θ) ^ (min ((budgetLevel δo WU R : ℕ) : ℤ)
            (δo + ArithmeticFunction.cardDistinctFactors D)).toNat ∣ a θ D := by
  obtain ⟨δo, hδ, -⟩ :=
    ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.oddMinimumF6_proof U M v adm Ccoarse hF5 hw
  exact ⟨δo, hδ, fun WU R hR =>
    sourceHyp_depth_of_isLeast U M hM v adm a hva Ccoarse hF5 hδ WU R hR⟩

/-- **PROVED (App G, Proposition `ex:app-odd-minimum`, tex 10190–10227; App F, tex 9450–9453,
9578–9584).** With the stage cores (`OddStageCore`, ELLIOT) at every stage, coefficients in
`𝒪/2^{M_θ}𝒪`, (F.5) at every stage and `δ_o` the least element of `DepthSet`: for every finite
operator budget `W_U` and `R ≥ 2`, on a set of stages in the ultrafilter, the stage is valid
(`OddStageSource`). -/
theorem oddStageSource_eventually (U : Ultrafilter ℕ) (M : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hM : Tendsto M (U : Filter ℕ) atTop) (v : ℕ → ℤ → WithTop ℤ) (adm : ℕ → ℤ → Prop)
    (η : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ)) (Good : ℕ → ℕ → Prop) (ap : ℕ → ℤ)
    (a : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ))
    (hcore : ∀ θ, OddStageCore O (M θ) (η θ) (Good θ) (fun n => adm θ n) ap (a θ))
    (hva : ∀ θ (D k : ℕ), Squarefree D → adm θ D → ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ v θ D →
      (2 : StageRing O (M θ)) ^ k ∣ a θ D)
    (Ccoarse : ℚ)
    (hF5 : ∀ θ D, adm θ D → ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.QLe
      (min (M θ : ℚ) (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega D - Ccoarse)) (v θ D))
    {δo : ℤ} (hδ : IsLeast (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.DepthSet U M v adm) δo)
    (WU R : ℕ) (hR : 2 ≤ R) :
    ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ),
      OddStageSource O WU R (M θ) δo (η θ) (Good θ) (fun n => adm θ n) ap (a θ) := by
  filter_upwards [sourceHyp_depth_of_isLeast U M hM v adm a hva Ccoarse hF5 hδ WU R hR]
    with θ hθ
  exact ⟨hθ.1, { toSourceCore := hcore θ, depth := hθ.2 }⟩

/-- **PROVED (App G, tex 10190–10227, from batch 3's `oddMinimumF6_proof`).** The same from the
fixed visible witness instead of the minimum: there is an integer `δ_o`, the least element of
`DepthSet`, such that for every budget the stage is valid eventually along the ultrafilter. -/
theorem oddStageSource_of_witness (U : Ultrafilter ℕ) (M : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hM : Tendsto M (U : Filter ℕ) atTop) (v : ℕ → ℤ → WithTop ℤ) (adm : ℕ → ℤ → Prop)
    (η : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ)) (Good : ℕ → ℕ → Prop) (ap : ℕ → ℤ)
    (a : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ))
    (hcore : ∀ θ, OddStageCore O (M θ) (η θ) (Good θ) (fun n => adm θ n) ap (a θ))
    (hva : ∀ θ (D k : ℕ), Squarefree D → adm θ D → ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ v θ D →
      (2 : StageRing O (M θ)) ^ k ∣ a θ D)
    (Ccoarse : ℚ)
    (hF5 : ∀ θ D, adm θ D → ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.QLe
      (min (M θ : ℚ) (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega D - Ccoarse)) (v θ D))
    (hw : ∃ Dw c : ℤ, ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ), adm θ Dw ∧ v θ Dw = (c : WithTop ℤ) ∧
      (c : WithTop ℤ) < M θ) :
    ∃ δo : ℤ, IsLeast (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.DepthSet U M v adm) δo ∧
      ∀ WU R : ℕ, 2 ≤ R → ∀ᶠ θ in (U : Filter ℕ),
        OddStageSource O WU R (M θ) δo (η θ) (Good θ) (fun n => adm θ n) ap (a θ) := by
  obtain ⟨δo, hδ, -⟩ :=
    ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.oddMinimumF6_proof U M v adm Ccoarse hF5 hw
  exact ⟨δo, hδ, fun WU R hR =>
    oddStageSource_eventually U M hM v adm η Good ap a hcore hva Ccoarse hF5 hδ WU R hR⟩

/-- **PROVED ((O.9) for the odd source, tex 9578–9584, with App G's stage choice, tex 10208–10227).**
"For the odd source, fix an integer `R ≥ 1` and a weight bound `W` first. At one sufficiently
advanced actual stage, simultaneously for all `U` with `w(U) ≤ W` and every Fourier index, (O.9)
holds with its right side replaced by its minimum with `R`": on a set of stages in the ultrafilter,
for every `U` in the budget and every index, `v₂ B_U[J r m²] ≥ min{R, ω(r)}` (here with `R ≥ 2`, as
App G fixes it). -/
theorem O9_eventually (U : Ultrafilter ℕ) (M : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hM : Tendsto M (U : Filter ℕ) atTop) (v : ℕ → ℤ → WithTop ℤ) (adm : ℕ → ℤ → Prop)
    (η : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ)) (Good : ℕ → ℕ → Prop) (ap : ℕ → ℤ)
    (a : (θ : ℕ) → ℕ → StageRing O (M θ))
    (hcore : ∀ θ, OddStageCore O (M θ) (η θ) (Good θ) (fun n => adm θ n) ap (a θ))
    (hva : ∀ θ (D k : ℕ), Squarefree D → adm θ D → ((k : ℤ) : WithTop ℤ) ≤ v θ D →
      (2 : StageRing O (M θ)) ^ k ∣ a θ D)
    (Ccoarse : ℚ)
    (hF5 : ∀ θ D, adm θ D → ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.QLe
      (min (M θ : ℚ) (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.omega D - Ccoarse)) (v θ D))
    {δo : ℤ} (hδ : IsLeast (ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.AppGEndpoints.DepthSet U M v adm) δo)
    (WU R : ℕ) (hR : 2 ≤ R) :
